    reversed: `Reversed, you are either abandoning the new thing because it is not impressive yet, or smothering it with adult panic — overexplaining, overfunding, overexposing it to win approval it does not need. Give the beginning a protection plan as simple as its needs: time, privacy, one believer. Omens that frighten you out of starting are usually just other people's fears wearing ceremonial dress.`,
