    reversed: `In shadow, the care has become the harm — overdosing others with help they never asked for, or treating your own neglect as toughness while the chart worsens. Know dose from damage. And watch for the caretakers, including parts of yourself, that need you sick: there are people whose place in your life depends on your not recovering. Your healing is allowed to inconvenience them.`,
