    reversed: `In shadow, you either live in the crypt — every gathering a séance, every decision referred to ghosts — or you have sealed it so tight the pressure bends the floorboards of everything above it. One treaty this week: a talk, a record set straight, a boundary with the family story that future-you will thank you for. Dynasties that keep the dead weaponized fear nothing more than a living person who negotiates in daylight.`,
